eType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30172,"speakerName":"大伴","textMapHash":3475381402,"text":"#{M#兄さん}{F#姉さん}は、この会場をずいぶん長いこと歩き回っているみたいだね。きっと芸術を楽しむことのできる風情の分かる方なんだろう。","nextNodeIds":[726910102]},{"nodeId":726910102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30172,"speakerName":"大伴","textMapHash":2947042794,"text":"実は、そんな風情あることで君に頼みたいことがあるんだが、手伝ってもらえないかな？","nextNodeIds":[726910103]},{"nodeId":726910103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3408038426,"text":"話してみて。","nextNodeIds":[726910104]},{"nodeId":726910104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30172,"speakerName":"大伴","textMapHash":3402880298,"text":"こちらのモンドから来た吟遊詩人、レネさんと俺は意気投合してね。","nextNodeIds":[726910105]},{"nodeId":726910105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":3465398722,"text":"ああ、大伴さんの言う通りなんだ。彼と知り合ってまだ数日しか経っていないのに、その知識の豊富さには感心されっぱなしだ。","nextNodeIds":[726910106]},{"nodeId":726910106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30172,"speakerName":"大伴","textMapHash":2288299570,"text":"ははっ、レネさんそれは褒めすぎだって。とにかく、俺たちは詩を以て友を会す詩人だ。だから、共に詩を書くことにした。","nextNodeIds":[726910107]},{"nodeId":726910107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30172,"speakerName":"大伴","textMapHash":3999413738,"text":"せっかく稲妻に来たんだし、レネさんもきっと稲妻の特色を取り入れた作品にしたいだろう。","nextNodeIds":[726910108]},{"nodeId":726910108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":2897274266,"text":"そうだね。でも今回のスケジュールはいっぱいいっぱいで、散策して観光するヒマがないんだ、残念なことにね。","nextNodeIds":[726910109]},{"nodeId":726910109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1138369642,"text":"何をしたらいいの？","nextNodeIds":[726910110]},{"nodeId":726910110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":1943788538,"text":"友よ、僕は「郷愁」をテーマにした詩を書いている。","nextNodeIds":[726910111]},{"nodeId":726910111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":1395344186,"text":"遊子という者は異郷の景色を目にすると、自然と故郷のことを思い出してしまう。だから、詩にこの土地ならではのものを入れたいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[726910112]},{"nodeId":726910112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":1824508954,"text":"創作のアイデアを得るために、写真機で写真を撮ってきてくれないだろうか。","nextNodeIds":[726910113]},{"nodeId":726910113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":4214397778,"text":"稲妻にも、この地ならではのものがたくさんあるだろう？たとえばモンドだったら、「蒲公英」と「風車アスター」を誰もが思い出すように…","nextNodeIds":[726910114]},{"nodeId":726910114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3170205178,"text":"おう、任せてくれ。稲妻の特産を写真で撮ればいいってことだよな。","nextNodeIds":[726910115]},{"nodeId":726910115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":4249022930,"text":"ああ、じゃあ頼んだよ！参考にこの途中まで書いた詩を君たちに渡そう。","nextNodeIds":[726910116]},{"nodeId":726910116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30173,"speakerName":"レネ","textMapHash":2952995922,"text":"写真の数はそうだね…それぞれ違ったものを映した写真が<color=#00E1FFFF>4枚</color>あれば十分なはずだ。報酬として、それ相応の旅費を払わせてもらうよ。","nextNodeIds":[726910117]},{"nodeId":726910117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3392970890,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、レネさんが欲しい写真も分かったし、さっそく出発しようぜ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7269101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["30172"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7269102,"order":2,"stepDescription":"稲妻の特産をテーマにした写真を4枚撮る","stepDescTextMapHash":3148829228,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_